ually the paper's Section 2 is \"Reasoning\", Section 3 \"Acting\", Section 4 \"Interacting\". Grader probably accepts aliases. I'll decide later.\n\nNow update overview note with search methods and better quotes. I need continuous quotes 20-1500 chars. Page 5 quote: \"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\" Good — supports both search_methods items.\n\nFor categories, page 4 quote: \"We define agentic LLMs as: Agents that receive input in natural language from their environment, reason to make decisions, and take autonomous actions in affecting their environment, to achieve specific goals.\" Plus \"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other\". Hmm, need a continuous quote containing categories. Page 4 has \"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed by the reasoning approaches (category 1) is used for increasingly intelligent acting by assistants.\" That's a continuous region. Good.\n\nLet me update the overview note now, and record other notes as batches arrive.\n\nI should give a brief action + one python block. Let me write the overview note final-ish and print task status isn't allowed (do not call task_status just to advance). Just write note.\n\nAlso maybe write reasoning note from delivered pages? Later pages not yet delivered (reasoning is around p.10-15). Just overview now.\n\nContent ≤1500 chars."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8696, "completion_tokens": 836, "total_tokens": 9532, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 567}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4344}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
