{"event": "agent_error", "time": 1793337378.367705, "run_id": "6be06d8a12304096898a8a4f0af98725", "seq": 166, "error_type": "AgentExecutionError", "error": "Code execution failed at line 'print(write_note(title='reasoning', content='reasoning 笔记（初版，依据 p.10-13）：\\n1) Self Consistency 的选择规则：对同一问题采样多条推理路径，再按多数投票（majority voting）统计各路径最终答案，取出现最多的那个答案，而不是只跟随单条路径（p.10-11, §2.1）。此项的逐字原文尚待从 p.10 提取结果复核后再补。\\n2) Tree of Thoughts 的两种搜索控制器（p.13 原文）：\"The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\" 即 breadth-first 与 depth-first。ToT 由 generation prompt、evaluation prompt 加外部搜索算法三者配合，遍历可回溯的推理步骤树（p.13, Fig.6）。\\n局限：外部搜索需外部记忆记录已走过的分支（p.15）。', evidence_ids=['ev-4049593a30e2846f8394'], section='reasoning'))' due to: ValueError: Note text must occur contiguously in the actual model response. Pass content as ONE string literal, not adjacent strings, concatenation or a variable; do not change the note text after generation."}
