 个 RapidAPI 的 API（p.23）：'ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.' 对比：ToolAlpaca 3938 实例/400 API。选择工具与汇总结果仍是难点，planner/caller/summarizer 分工（p.23）。\", evidence_ids=['ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62'], section=\"tool_use\")\nprint(r)\nrecall(['ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1','ev-daeb56e673fc61cae0ef','ev-a30e6edea79391cf315d','ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689','ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f','ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d','ev-97c7764bd93b97111551','ev-2c646589154451e7b722'])\n```", "code_action": "r = write_note(title=\"tool_use\", content=\"tool_use 主题笔记（p.23）：Toolformer 让模型自学调用 API，自行决定调用哪个 API、何时调用、传什么参数、如何把结果并入后续 token 预测（p.23）。测试的五种工具：calculator、question_answering、search_engine、translation_system、calendar（原文：'A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.'）。ToolBench 收录 16,464 个 RapidAPI 的 API（p.23）：'ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.' 对比：ToolAlpaca 3938 实例/400 API。选择工具与汇总结果仍是难点，planner/caller/summarizer 分工（p.23）。\", evidence_ids=['ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62'], section=\"tool_use\")\nprint(r)\nrecall(['ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1','ev-daeb56e673fc61cae0ef','ev-a30e6edea79391cf315d','ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689','ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f','ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d','ev-97c7764bd93b97111551','ev-2c646589154451e7b722'])", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'tool_use', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 542}\nLast output from code snippet:\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:24'}, {'id': 'ev-daeb56e673fc61cae0ef', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:25'}, {'id': 'ev-a30e6edea79391cf315d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:26'}, {'id': 'ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:27'}, {'id': 'ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:28'}, {'id': 'ev-81117fe71aa5d10b54