": 4352}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8568, "output_tokens": 884, "total_tokens": 9452}}, "model_output": "Pages 30–31 confirm the end of the \"acting\" part. Next I will get the remaining missing pages in bounded batches, starting with 32–37.\n\n```python\nr = recall(['ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055','ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186','ev-41048209f3096e51f36b','ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2','ev-345e6706309ac04ee927','ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da'])\nprint(r)\n```", "code_action": "r = recall(['ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055','ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186','ev-41048209f3096e51f36b','ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2','ev-345e6706309ac04ee927','ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da'])\nprint(r)", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:32'}, {'id': 'ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:33'}, {'id': 'ev-41048209f3096e51f36b', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:34'}, {'id': 'ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:35'}, {'id': 'ev-345e6706309ac04ee927', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:36'}, {'id': 'ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:37'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:32'}, {'id': 'ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:33'}, {'id': 'ev-41048209f3096e51f36b', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:34'}, {'id': 'ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:35'}, {'id': 'ev-345e6706309ac04ee927', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:36'}, {'id': 'ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:37'}, {'id': 'ev-2f8846ab5b1bc7072a1b', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:38'}, {'id': 'ev-76027d4e758f97793930', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:39'}], 'requested_count': 6, 'queued_count': 21, 'message': 'Queued, not delivered; the selector chooses the actual next batch.'}\nLast output from code sn