batch: 4,5,23.\n\nActually wait — I need quotes that are contiguous 20-1500 chars containing key content. For overview categories, a sentence on p.4 or 5 naming the three categories. For search methods, p.5 text about Google Scholar and snowballing.\n\nLet me recall p.4 and 5 first."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 9170, "completion_tokens": 545, "total_tokens": 9715, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 472}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4946}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
