{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793338003.8936422, "run_id": "6be06d8a12304096898a8a4f0af98725", "seq": 437, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "reasoning", "content": "reasoning（p.10-13）：Self Consistency 对同一问题采样多条推理路径，再按多数投票（majority voting）选出最一致的答案（p.10）：\"Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.\" Tree of Thoughts 结合 generation prompt、evaluation prompt 与外部搜索算法遍历推理步骤树，论文给出两种搜索控制器：breadth-first 与 depth-first（p.13）。外部搜索与自反思需要 LLM 调用之间的外部记忆，如 ToT 必须记住已探过的分支（p.15）。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3"], "section": "reasoning"}}
