ning paths, evaluates them,\np10| and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting. It improves the performance of Chain of Thought\np10| Chain of Thought and Self Consistency are being used to train most modern reasoning LLMs, including OpenAI\n--- p13 ---\np13| the Tree of Thoughts approach [Yao et al., 2024]. Here, an external control algorithm is created, that calls the\np13| has been traversed, the search backtracks, and tries an alternative. The paper describes both a breadth-first and a\np13| depth-first controller.\nLast output from code snippet:\n", "observations_images": null, "action_output": "", "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 9083, "output_tokens": 1769, "total_tokens": 10852}, "is_final_answer": false}}
